  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.Web10.Core v2.0.3\n\nThe Core for WEB10 (The Source / WEB0) - the root source-of-truth layer of the OASIS Omniverse. The SourceManager returns the foundational OASIS_DNA configuration (the Alpha) together with WEB9 live unified status across WEB4-WEB8 (the Omega), closing the loop where WEB10 = WEB0.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/WEB10/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.Web10.Core",
